{"product":{"id":6830857519171,"title":"STB19 LED Cast Brass Deck Step Light Surface Mount 12V Low Voltage Landscape Lighting","body_html":"\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #ff0b0b;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #fa0b0b;\"\u003e| \u003ca style=\"color: #fa0b0b;\" title=\"STB19 Cast Brass Deck Light Installation Guide\" href=\"https:\/\/www.abbalightingusa.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/02\/STB19-INSTALLATION-GUIDE-2.6.2026-4.27-PM.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"\u003eSTB\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #ff0b0b; text-decoration: underline;\" color=\"#ff0b0b\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"\u003e19 Installation Guide\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e |\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #fc0505;\"\u003e| \u003ca style=\"color: #fc0505;\" title=\"STB19 Cast Brass Deck Light Spec Sheet\" href=\"https:\/\/www.abbalightingusa.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/02\/STB19-SPEC-SHEET-2.6.2026-3.02-PM-Cxxx.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"\u003eSTB\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #ff0b0b;\" color=\"#ff0b0b\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"\u003e19 Spec Sheet\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e |\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\nThis STB19 LED \u003cstrong\u003eCast Brass Mini Deck Step Light\u003c\/strong\u003e is an attractive addition to any outdoor or indoor space. Its heavy-duty construction and choice of Natural Brass, Black, or White finishes lend class and style. Simple to install with just one screw, it is \u003cstrong\u003eIP65 waterproof\u003c\/strong\u003e and consumes less energy than other lighting options, making it more reliable, safe, and cost-efficient. It also serves as an excellent \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/kingsoutdoorlighting.com\/collections\/stair-step-lights\" title=\"low voltage stair light\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"\u003elow voltage stair light\u003c\/a\u003e, ideal for enhancing safety and ambiance on steps without increasing energy costs.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eIts \u003cstrong\u003e3W AC\/DC 12V LED\u003c\/strong\u003e produces \u003cstrong\u003e3000K Warm White\u003c\/strong\u003e light with a peak illumination effect, and its dimensions are 2\" (L) x 1\" (W) x 1.5\" (H). This product is \u003cstrong\u003eETL listed\u003c\/strong\u003e. It's a great choice for both style and value, perfect for illuminating decks, stairs, and pathways. No matter the time of day, you'll have quality light without breaking the bank.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\"\u003eIt’s a perfect choice for stairways, patio, garden, porch, lawn, pathways, driveways or any other landscape places. All of our products are backed by our manufacturer's money-back guarantee ensuring you receive a quality product free from defects. We Provide the best product quality and service. Feel free to contact us for any help or advice with this product!\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAll low voltage outdoor lights must be installed with a\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/kingsoutdoorlighting.com\/collections\/low-voltage-transformers\"\u003e12V Low Voltage Transformer\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eand connections between lights must be secured using Grease Filled Wire Nuts (\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/kingsoutdoorlighting.com\/products\/wn12-grease-filled-wire-nut-for-landscape-lighting-installation\"\u003eWN12\u003c\/a\u003e) waterproof connectors.\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #ff0000;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eReason to Buy from Us:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eNo surprises or hidden fees.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSafe payments via PayPal.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003e30 Day Money Back Guarantee.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eReal helpful humans on our support helpdesk!\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTracking number for every order\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cimg height=\"77\" width=\"71\" alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0076\/5093\/4831\/files\/LED_G4_small.png?v=1562616568\"\u003e \u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0076\/5093\/4831\/files\/green-energy_small.png?v=1562437826\" alt=\"\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\"\u003e  \u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0076\/5093\/4831\/files\/IP65_logo_small.png?v=1562444346\" alt=\"\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\"\u003e \u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0076\/5093\/4831\/files\/ETL_mark_small.png?v=1562442548\" alt=\"\" width=\"83\" height=\"65\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"driveway-chrome-extension-capture-highlight-container\" class=\"drvwyExtnsn\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"driveway-chrome-extension-live-view-highlight-container\" class=\"drvwyExtnsn\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e","vendor":"ABBA Lighting USA","produ